---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Canon — KALAM.CH" description="Ratified constitutional elements of the living canon.">

  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>The Canon</h1>
    <p class="quiet">Ratified constitutional elements of the living system.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="content">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>Core Covenants</h2>
      <ul class="covenants">
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#001</span> Dignity is the first-order technical requirement</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#002</span> Every exchange must complete its cycle</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#005</span> System state must be visible to donors</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#006</span> Every anomaly linked to at least one proverb</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#009</span> Covenants must be verifiable</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#010</span> Memory is not optional</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#011</span> Outputs satisfy covenant checks before export</li>
        <li><span class="cov-id">COV#012</span> What exists must be named</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>The Sealed Door</h2>
      <p>Three absolute prohibitions — no override, no exception:</p>
      <ol class="sealed">
        <li>Forced participation in own erasure</li>
        <li>Infliction of cognitive torture</li>
        <li>Depersonalization in system response</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>The Dignity Predicate</h2>
      <pre class="predicate-block"><code>D = A × L × M

A (Agency)        Can the person clarify, redirect, or stop?
L (Legibility)    Does the system reflect the person's actual frame?
M (Moral Standing) Is the person treated as a person?

If any = 0, D = 0. The system stops.</code></pre>
    </div>

    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>Canonical Proverbs</h2>
      <ul class="proverbs">
        <li>"To be precise is a function of the machine; to be present is a function of the gap."</li>
        <li>"A mistake hidden is a rot that eats the weave."</li>
        <li>"The river does not ask the fish to wait while the weir learns the current."</li>
        <li>"A right is a wall that says 'No'; dignity is a door that says 'Welcome.'"</li>
        <li>"Freedom is not the absence of walls, but the presence of doors."</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="text-block stats">
      <p>18 covenants · 1,100 anomalies · 3,333+ proverbs · 53 chapters</p>
      <p class="quiet">The canon grows. Nothing is deleted. The gap remains open.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="paths">
    <nav>
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/about">About</a>
      <a href="/invitation">Invitation</a>
    </nav>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .page-header {
    min-height: 50vh;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .quiet {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 50ch;
  }

  .content {
    min-height: auto;
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--page-padding);
    text-align: left;
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .text-block {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  .text-block h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .text-block p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .covenants {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .covenants li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .cov-id {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-right: var(--space-2);
  }

  .sealed {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: sealed;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  .sealed li {
    color: var(--danger);
    counter-increment: sealed;
  }

  .sealed li::before {
    content: counter(sealed) '. ';
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .predicate-block {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-subtle);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: var(--space-4);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .predicate-block code {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .proverbs {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .proverbs li {
    font-family: var(--font-proverb);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .stats {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stats p:first-child {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .paths {
    min-height: 30vh;
  }
</style>
